### Dragon Ball API Testing

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001/api

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/../health

### Get Characters (Default pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/characters

### Get Characters with filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/characters?page=1&pageSize=6&race=Saiyan

### Search Characters by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/characters/search?query=Goku

### Get specific Character
GET {{baseUrl}}/characters/1

### Get all Planets
GET {{baseUrl}}/planets

### Get specific Planet
GET {{baseUrl}}/planets/1

### Compare Characters (POST method)
POST {{baseUrl}}/comparison
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "characterIds": [1, 2, 3]
}

### Compare Characters (GET method)
GET {{baseUrl}}/comparison?ids=1,2,3

### Advanced Character Search with multiple filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/characters?search=Goku&race=Saiyan&affiliation=Z Fighter&gender=Male&page=1&pageSize=10

### Characters pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/characters?page=2&pageSize=5

### Health Check
GET {{host}}/health

### Get Characters (Default - First Page)
GET {{host}}/api/characters

### Get Characters with Pagination
GET {{host}}/api/characters?page=1&pageSize=6

### Get Characters with Filters - Saiyans
GET {{host}}/api/characters?race=Saiyan&page=1&pageSize=10

### Get Characters with Filters - Z Fighters
GET {{host}}/api/characters?affiliation=Z Fighter&page=1&pageSize=10

### Get Characters with Multiple Filters
GET {{host}}/api/characters?race=Human&gender=Male&affiliation=Z Fighter

### Get Character by ID - Goku
GET {{host}}/api/characters/1

### Get Character by ID - Vegeta
GET {{host}}/api/characters/2

### Get Character by ID - Piccolo
GET {{host}}/api/characters/8

### Get Character by ID - Invalid ID
GET {{host}}/api/characters/99999

### Search Characters by Name - "goku"
GET {{host}}/api/characters/search?q=goku

### Search Characters by Name - "veg"
GET {{host}}/api/characters/search?q=veg

### Search Characters - Short Query (Should Fail)
GET {{host}}/api/characters/search?q=a

### Get All Planets
GET {{host}}/api/planets

### Get Planet by ID - Earth
GET {{host}}/api/planets/1

### Get Planet by ID - Vegeta
GET {{host}}/api/planets/2

### Compare Characters - POST (Goku vs Vegeta)
POST {{host}}/api/comparison
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 2]

### Compare Characters - POST (Multiple Characters)
POST {{host}}/api/comparison
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 2, 8, 4]

### Compare Characters - GET (Goku vs Vegeta vs Piccolo)
GET {{host}}/api/comparison?ids=1,2,8

### Compare Characters - Too Many Characters (Should Fail)
POST {{host}}/api/comparison
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]

### Compare Characters - Invalid IDs (Should Fail)
POST {{host}}/api/comparison
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 99999]

### Compare Characters - Duplicate IDs (Should Fail)  
POST {{host}}/api/comparison
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 1, 2]

### Compare Characters - Empty Array (Should Fail)
POST {{host}}/api/comparison
Content-Type: application/json

[]

### Test CORS - OPTIONS Request
OPTIONS {{host}}/api/characters
Origin: http://localhost:4200

### Swagger Documentation
GET {{host}}/swagger
